  "body": "\nBugfixes - 21.14.13\n===================\n\n- Stop bash running commands from `--prompt` or an environment name containing `$(...)`, backticks or a backslash\n  after `shopt -s promptvars`, `set -o posix`, or in a child shell that inherits an exported `PS1`\n  (GHSA-cx6f-vjhg-g3cc); reported by rozzkml. zsh now draws the prompt from `psvar[9]`, which is never parsed\n  as shell syntax.\n\n  Write the `.venv` redirect and the wheel `RECORD` with exclusive create, so a link planted after the existence\n  check cannot redirect the write. On POSIX, a read-only `.venv` redirect that points at a virtualenv is replaced.\n  (#3466)\n\n\n[PyPI release](https://pypi.org/project/virtualenv/21.14.13/)\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/pypa/virtualenv/compare/21.14.12...21.14.13\n"
